[indent]•  [color=#0066FF][url={"research": "孙权", "cat": "people"}]孙权[/url][/color]遣将军[color=#000000]周贺[/color]、校尉[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "裴潜", "cat": "people"}]裴潜[/url][/color]乘海赴辽东购名马（互市）[/indent]
